# Highmoor Lodge's wine cellar (CIPlay highmoor_lodge_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the
# recipe: kit_st mouth at 15 10 (yaw 120: way in = +x -z), tunnel 7.3 m, the den ~22 m on (middle ~30.6 1), its own knoll
# (hill=1); the sign hlcellarsign at 7 4; a boar (hlboar) in the den; zone hl_cellar at 25 4. Floor ~5 m (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Highmoor Lodge keep
offset -0.6789 -0.0309
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and the mouth from the kitchen yard
picture hl_cellar_out 6 +3 12 15 +1.5 10
read WINE CELLAR

# The boar in the cellar (11-12 mixed monsters): alive, inside the cave
wait 3
expect animals Boar 1
expect animalsinside Boar 1
kill Boar
expect animals Boar 0

# In along the tunnel to the den
walk 8 5 to 12 8 to 15 10 to 21.3 6.4 to 25 4
zone hl_cellar
picture hl_cellar_in 19 +2.5 7.5 30.6 +0.5 1 light=20
walk 25 4 to 21.3 6.4 to 15 10 to 12 8
